// r5 authored refinement after r3 + motion + r4-shape + r4-surface.
// Inspected actual r4 native three-quarter/side/front views and saved references.
// CSV SWB-27 is the upright animal; SWB-28 is the close portrait (contact-sheet index27).
// These are image-informed artistic estimates, not calibrated/specimen measurements.
// All existing IDs, joint landmarks, motion keys and contact targets remain retained.
// One indexed reconstruction per edit: no namespace capture inside Vibe0.1 lambdas.
// Neutral grizzled greys unify body and limbs; retained undercoat warmth is restrained.
